*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Molecule: LiH
* Basis: STO-3G
* Symmetry: C1 (None)
* Features tested: single-root L-PDFT, LPDFT transition-density HDF5
* Responsible person: Bhavnesh Jangid, University of Chicago, 2026
* Comments: Edge test for the one-root path, where no off-diagonal
*           spin-summed two-particle transition density is consumed.
*           This should be equals to the MC-PDFT energy.
*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>> EXPORT MOLCAS_NOCHECK=MLTPL
>> RM -FORCE TEST_HDF5
>> IF ( $MOLCAS_DRIVER = UNKNOWN_VARIABLE )
>>   EXPORT MOLCAS_DRIVER=molcas
>> ENDIF
>> SHELL $MOLCAS_DRIVER have_feature hdf5 || touch TEST_HDF5
>> IF ( -FILE TEST_HDF5 )
>>   EXIT 36
>> ENDIF

&GATEWAY
  Coord
    2
    Angstrom
    Li  0.0  0.0  0.0
    H   0.0  0.0  0.8
  Group = NoSym
  Basis = STO-3G
  NoCD

&SEWARD
  Grid Input
    Grid = Coarse
  End of Grid Input

>> COPY InitOrb $Project.ScfOrb

&RASSCF
  CIONly
  LumOrb
  Spin = 1
  NActEl = 2 0 0
  Inactive = 1
  Ras2 = 2
  CIRoot = 1 1 1
  LPDF

&MCPDFT
  Functional = T:PBE
  LPDF
  MSPD
  WJOB

